      "message": "It seems a little odd to have the GPIOs listed here as well as passed into the various functions that need to use them.  Would it make more sense to add a spi_device_t struct that points to a spi_port_t as well as contains the devices CS GPIO?  That way the various transaction functions could just take a spi_device_t.  Or perhaps the transaction functions should take a spi_port_t and a device index instead of a gpio_signal?  Then use that index to look into this table, ensuring consistent use of GPIOs.",
